The core source finding is real: the rc.5 driver inventory supports only macOS and Windows, while the target task still requires full candidate execution and `go test -race ./...` on Linux. However, the submitted map resolves that contradiction by silently narrowing Linux test/race coverage, and it leaves the candidate transport/runner mechanism undecided. I’m verifying these gaps against the exact target AC before recording the verdict.
